==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*žьdati|gloss=to wait, to await}}, from {{der|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*g(e)id-}}, from {{der|ru|ine-pro|*gʰeydʰ-}}. Compare {{cog|goh|gīt||avarice}} and {{cog|prg|gēide||they are waiting}}.<ref>{{R:ru:Tsyganenko||127}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ждать.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ждать .ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|ждать|impf|pf=подожда́ть|vn=ждун<q:nomen agentis>}}

# {{lb|ru|transitive}} to [[wait for]] {{gloss|to stay where one is or delay action}} {{+obj|ru|gen|acc}}
#: {{syn|ru|ожида́ть}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''ждать''' [[мать]]|'''to wait for''' one's mother}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''ждать''' [[поезд|по́езда]]|'''to wait for''' a train}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''ждать''' [[по́езд]]|'''to wait for''' the train}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''ждать''' [[свой|свое́й]] [[очередь|о́череди]]|'''to wait [for]''' one's turn}}
# {{lb|ru|intransitive}} to [[wait]] {{gloss|to stay where one is or delay action}}
# {{lb|ru|transitive}} to [[wait for]] {{gloss|to eagerly expect something}} {{+obj|ru|gen}}
#: {{syn|ru|ожида́ть}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[она|Она́]] '''ждёт''' [[конец|конца́]] [[война|войны́]].|She's '''waiting for''' the war to end.}}
# {{lb|ru|transitive|intransitive}} to [[expect]], to [[wait]] {{gloss|to believe that something will happen or count on something happening}} {{+obj|ru|gen}}
#: {{syn|ru|ожида́ть}}
#: {{coi|ru|'''ждать''', [[что]] [[всё]] [[уладиться|ула́дится]]|expect things to work out}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[я|Я]] '''жду''' [[от]] [[он|него́]] [[извинение|извине́ний]].|I '''expect''' him to apologize.}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[не|Не]] '''жди''', [[я]] [[не]] [[позвонить|позвоню́]]!|Don't '''wait''', I won't call!}}
# {{lb|ru|figurative|transitive|in third person only}} to [[await]] {{gloss|to be in store for, to be ready for}} {{+obj|ru|acc}}
#: {{syn|ru|ожида́ть}}
#: {{ux|ru|[[они|Их]] '''ждёт''' [[ги́бель]].|Their doom '''awaits''' them.|lit=Death '''awaits''' them.}}

====Usage notes====
